        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt for 2-1/4 Door Thickness</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 2-1/4 Inch Thick Door Single Cylinder Deadbolt will fit all standard door cutouts. For use on <b>1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" thick doors or gates</b>. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. ANSI Grade 1 deadbolt, operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. Available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-thick-door-deadbolt-db60-61073\"><b>B60/61073 Deadbolt For Extra Thick Doors</b></a> and <a href=\"/collections/thick-door-locks\"><b>Thick Door Locks</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese deadbolts are bigger and stronger than they were before. They are ANSI <b>Grade 1</b>--the toughest ANSI grade available. Sturdy construction paired with innovative features that provide added control, security and peace of mind.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the DB60/61072 2-1/4\" Thick Door Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>High Security Deadbolts.</li>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5, 2001, Grade 1 auxiliary lock.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<Li>Has an anti-pick shield around the cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder and trim.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/B60-install.pdf?v=1704262172\" target=\"new\"><b>Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DB60/61072 2-1/4\" Thick Door Deadbolt Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" and 1-1/2\" Bore Hole</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable deadbolt fits both 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>Housing Diameter: 2.420\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: 5-pin, Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: For use with <b>1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors</b>. For standard 1-3/4\" thick doors use this <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-maximum-security-grade-1-deadbolt-schlage-b60\"><b> Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
