                "description": "This 2-1/4 Inch Thick Door Single Cylinder Deadbolt  will fit all standard door cutouts. For use on 1-3/4 inch - 2-1/4 inch thick doors or gates. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. ANSI Grade 1 deadbolt, operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. Available in 9 finishes.",
